 "locales": {
  "en": {
   "70d3ea0b80ba66236c456096 name": "Wild Wild Woods",
   "70d3ea0b80ba66236c456096 description": "Have you seen what's been going on in Priozersk lately? The Scavs have gone wild. Splinter gangs no longer take Fence's orders and shoot at anyone they meet. They are armed with revolvers and lever-action rifles, so they clearly looted someone's stash. Rumor has it the rebels are hauling the loot into the nature reserve, where a ton of valuables can now be found. Shturman is in every raid now, and he always carries a Silver Badge. Bring me twelve of those badges, found in raid, and the reserve will be worth your time.",
   "70d3ea0b80ba66236c456096 successMessageText": "Twelve badges. So the rumor was true. The reserve is full of valuables now - go get your share before the gangs haul it all away.",
   "2534f95dcc0bc69f847681fd name": "Eliminate Scavs",
   "2534f95dcc0bc69f847681fd description": "Fence wants the mutinous Scavs thinned out. Eighteen of them, any location, no questions asked.",
   "2534f95dcc0bc69f847681fd successMessageText": "Eighteen gone. The rest will think twice before ignoring me again.",
   "085474a2a5eb5b70109b2c32 name": "Find and extract: Bolt-action rifles",
   "085474a2a5eb5b70109b2c32 description": "Fence needs bolt-action rifles. Find four of them in a single raid and get them out with you.",
   "085474a2a5eb5b70109b2c32 successMessageText": "Bolt-action rifles, four of them, still in one piece. Good work.",
   "aaff707f1fbae7ceefd9de42 name": "Find and extract: Provisions",
   "aaff707f1fbae7ceefd9de42 description": "Fence needs food and drink for the people hiding out in the reserve. Ten items, found in one raid, extracted with you.",
   "aaff707f1fbae7ceefd9de42 successMessageText": "Ten provisions. That will keep them fed for a while. Fence owes you.",
